# Testing Rules

- Add regression tests for every bug fix.
- Backend behavior should have pytest coverage.
- Core user flows should have integration or end-to-end coverage where practical.
- Do not skip failing tests unless the skip documents a real external blocker.
- Update `docs/TESTING.md` when test strategy changes.
